    "title_en": "Reference Tracking System for Performance Studies of Small Straw Tracker Prototypes for the Future SPD Detector at the NICA Collider",
    "abstract_en": "This paper presents performance studies of small straw tracker prototypes developed for further application in SPD NICA. To evaluate straw tracker prototype performance, reference tracking and timing system was used. Data collected during a muon test beam campaign at the SPS H4 beam line was analyzed.",
